        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ep 4.2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Ento wun aye jo ma Lubaŋa doŋ oyero, jo maleŋ ma Lubaŋa maro; pi meno myero doŋ wuruk cwiny ma miyo wuparo pi can pa luwotwu, wubed ki kica, mwolo, woro ki diyo cwiny. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.4.32"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ep 4.32",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wudi cwinywu kekenwu, ŋat acel acel odi cwinye i kom lawote, kun wutimo kica ki luwotwu i kinwu kekenwu pi balwu. Ka ŋat mo i kinwu tye ki lok mo i kom lawote, timo kica pi bal myero obed tye macalo Rwot bene ceŋ otimowu kica. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ento makato magi ducu, myero wubed kun wupoŋ ki mar. Pien mar keken aye tweyo jami ducu, ribogi kacel ma cobo bene maber licwic. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wuwek kuc pa Kricito ma yam olwoŋowu i kom acel aye olo cwinywu, ka wek doŋ wubed jo ma miyo pwoc kare ducu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.5.19"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ep 5.19",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": ",",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EPH.5.20"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "20",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wuwek lok pa Kricito obed i iwu mulony, ka wupwonnye, kun wujukke bene kekenwu ki ryeko ducu ma Lubaŋa omiyowu. Dok bene ka wuwero jabuli, wer me pako Lubaŋa ki wer mogo mukene me dini, wuwer bot Lubaŋa ki pwoc i cwinywu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gin ducu ma wutiyo, kadi ki i lok nyo i tic mogo, wutigi i nyiŋ Rwot Yecu, kun wumiyo pwoc bot Lubaŋa Won wok ki bote.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
