            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Wun lutic, myero wuwiny luditowu me lobo man i lok ducu ki cwiny acel, pe i tic ma bwolo waŋ dano keken, kun wumito wuyom cwiny dano, ento wuti i cwiny me lworo Rwot. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 3:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tic mo keken ma wutiyo, wuti maber ki cwinywu ducu, macalo wutiyo bot Rwot, ento pe pi dano. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.3.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.3.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
